The hives, devices, measurements and alerts come from the BEEP account of each
user, through the BEEP API (https://api.beep.nl), the open source bee
monitoring platform of the BEEP foundation (https://beep.nl). The routes and
answers of the API were read in the source of BEEP
(https://github.com/beepnl/BEEP, AGPL-3.0); no BEEP code is copied here.

